        },
        {
          "text": "Mubulenge obu bupya taakwe mu-Helene nanka mu-Juda, taakwe mupalule nanka silulomo, taakwe uubwelebweza, taakwe mu-Skuti, taakwe muzike nanka muzyale, pele Kristo alike nguuliwo, nguukede muzintu zyoonse.",
          "type": "text",
