                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubalanda, amumvwe basimalelo banu baansi kuzintu zyoonse nzibamulailila. Milimo yanu itabi yakumeso buyo yakubotezya bantu, ibe yamoyo omwe cakulemeka Mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.22"
            ]
